 "script": [
  {
   "id": "hook",
   "text": "A climate summit just opened with a fight over money. Who will pay?"
  },
  {
   "id": "f1",
   "text": "COP thirty-one opened Monday in Antalya, Türkiye. U.N. chief António Guterres told leaders to get serious. He said the world has entered a new age of climate extremes. AFP reports the opening ceremony started about ninety minutes late."
  },
  {
   "id": "f2",
   "text": "The first fight was over the agenda. Developing countries wanted climate finance items added. AFP reports a finance work programme is in. A separate point on tripling adaptation finance is not. It will be discussed under other items."
  },
  {
   "id": "f3",
   "text": "Money looks tight. A senior E.U. official said last week there would be no political will for extra pledges. AFP also reports the U.S. sent no officials. The talks run until November twentieth."
  },
  {
   "id": "cta",
   "text": "Will rich countries add climate money by November twentieth? Yes or no?"
  }
 ],
